## For agents working on this space {id="org-home-agents"}

- Treat `package.json` `version` and `CHANGELOG.md` as the version source; the README download links and `index.html` must match.
- Never put real employee data into fixtures, drills or wiki pages. Samples are fictional.
- The MCP bridge (`npm run mcp`) is read-only by default; `ORGFLOW_ALLOW_PROPOSALS=true` only enables Draft proposals. No tool approves or applies changes.
